    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Geno ma yumalo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kidamba ri jokwath ma joreyo aka jokedho rombo ma lum paran! Rwoth waco. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Riameno me apaka Rwoth, Were pa Isiraili waco, kwoŋ jokwath ma jokwayo ji paran: “Obedo win ma witieko kedho rombo paran, aka witieko riemo jo woko, aka wikidewo kwoŋ jo. Riameno alatic gi win ro tim mewin marac, Rwoth waco. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo an won gipi alacoko rombo paran m'odoŋ wok i piny m'atieko kedh'iye jo, t'adwoko jo i sidwol pajo, jolanywol to jonyay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alaketho jokwath ma kikwonga. Ji paran jok'obedi malwor kendo, kosa jok'obwok, kosa ongoye m'orweny, Rwoth waco.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.33.14+JER.33.15+JER.33.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 33:14-16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hongo bino adieri, Rwoth waco, m'abino yer'iye kere ma jatiro nyakwar Daudi. Go bino dhumo gi rieko to timo gir'adieri kodi tiro i piny gipi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I hongo pere ilabotho Yuda kodi Isiraili aka ji ma Isiraili jolabedo i siem. Aka me a nyingi m'ibino lwoŋo gine go: “Rwoth a tiro mawan.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Riameno, hongo bino adieri, Rwoth waco, ma k'owaci kendo ni, “Paka Were kwo go m'ofudho ji ma Isiraili woko ma piny Misir. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kucel, jolakwoŋere kodan paka Were makwo m'ofudho ji ma Isiraili woko ma yumalo kodi wok i piny je m'oyido akedh'iye jo.” Kenyo jolabedo i piny pajo won.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mikwenda ma mako jotuci wac Were",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwoth pa lwak jolweny waco ama ri ji ma Yerusalem: Wikiri wiwinji wac ma jotuci wac Were no jowaco riwin; jowaco riwin gitwodo. Joluwo kwoŋ menyirok ma paro pajo wegi, ma k'owoki i dhok Rwoth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jowaco noknok ri jono ma jobwono wac pa Rwoth ni, “Gigipiny lakadho riwin maber kodi ri ji je ma wiy gin tek ma wegi jotimo gima jomito, ka jowaco ni, ‘Ongoye teko ma lapodho kwoŋ win.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abedo Were macegin, Rwoth penjo, makiweno mabor? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jokune ma jonyalo pondo kam'opanere ŋey akir'anen jo? Rwoth penjo. Wikuya ni anitie kisi kamoro i polo kodi i piny? Rwoth penjo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atieko winjo gima jotuci wac Were jotieko waco ma jotuco wac ma twodo i nyingan, ka jowaco ni, “Aleko, aleko!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiri keraŋo ma jotuci wac Were no jomien ji paran gi luwo twodo, gi joma joluwo twodo mar'adundin pajo wegi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jotimo can ma miyo wiy ji paran wil kodan gi lek pajo ma jokowo ri wadi gin, paka wiy kwarere pajo owil kodan kwoŋbedo Bal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Weyi jotuci wac Were manitie gi lek wowaci, to weyi ŋata nitie gi wac paran woluwi wac paran ma k'onyeko. Bero aŋo ma kanja nitie gine k'opima gi ŋano? Rwoth penjo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wac paran kicale gi mac, Rwoth penjo, paka nyundu ma baro tele mathindho thindho? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Riameno, abedo jakwor pa jotuci wac Were ma jokwalo wac paran bongi wadi gin, Rwoth waco. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abedo jakwor pa jotuci wac Were ma wegi joluwo wac pajo to jokethere ni owok bongan, Rwoth waco. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Winji win, abedo jakwor pa jono ma joluwo twodo, Rwoth waco, ma joluwo to jorwenyo ji paran gi twodo pajo gi timo gigipiny kicar, m'akioro jo kosa aketho jo; ameno ongoye gimoro kad'acel ma jokonyo gine ji me, Rwoth waco.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Bieto pa Rwoth",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwoth owaco ran ni, “Yeremia, ka ŋat'acel kwoŋ ji me kosa jatuci wac Were kosa jacway ri Were i wi migam openjin ni, ‘Bieto pa Rwoth obedo aŋo?’ Iwaci rigo ni, ‘Iŋat'ibedo bieto ri Rwoth, aka go lajwangin, Rwoth waco.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka ŋatimoro kwoŋ ji paran, kosa jatuci wac Were kosa jacway ri Were i wi migam bende oor wac ni bieto pa Rwoth, alamiyo jo gir'acula kodi pecin pajo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kucel, joripo penjo wadi jo kodi wade pajo ni, Radwok aŋo ma Rwoth omiyo? Rwoth owaco nedi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameno jokiripi kendo oro wac ni bieto pa Rwoth, rupiri ka ŋatimoro otim, alaloko mikwenda paran bieto mar'adieri rigo. Ji jotieko wiro woko wac pa Were makwo, Rwoth pa lwak jolweny, Were mawan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeremia, ipenji jotuci wac Were no ama: Radwok aŋo ma Rwoth omiyo win? Rwoth owaco nedi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
